        out (Tensor, optional): the output tensor. Ignored if :attr:`out` = ``None``.

    Returns:
        Tensor: if the :math:`i^{th}` tensor was of dimensions :math:`p_{i} \times p_{i + 1}`, then the product
        would be of dimensions :math:`p_{1} \times p_{N + 1}`.

